 effectively. It's always helpful to provide clear information that others can easily digest! Let's explore what those bullet points could look like.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0e754b82ab019da10169e1cfa913f881939c20f35469cef35a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp4dAF6jCWCgzwgkHDHy7pKP8IBixYZ4CYfSgqdCq8q9Pry9vgHEjndHjklF9hwgjtOeGVGH91AxPGVkCSdmpYquNZPvKhSEXV-yMAhcmFmlbRNuD8xxqzOFGHWBKgj97pglH8A2K3ejrCaWb06s2c-aFhbgbVrqG7J4A_Pjir74CmT3nbC1Z6PSgJ7CFHE3vRW1zqSYiwO2IyMCFWb48hhfSZNSFO9zwCW3j7ElI00F-EGODXTcQTifCPZ227aUNT3GVf9ZXwC0ylfaLv4K8xUQ8UZMjLCPcuPGbg8URX7ktt_IfRDCeZ52u95XCpOW0McBZRcQ3vPxpC59x0CIrccjJwKtXmdUYd4Fx0CcDTAEEKb0hl4AJY6YrUOeSKw1kZR33rfnASAslOanuPUFBGkFmy1K_W1_Qszv0ND4IAHvyF3gcbFEHx1YzjePmalmFDw1PhGeBx7Fg1ajMYQHVMLKItQctcjU7SilAPGIQdjN_DNrS9app_l7BDJFmCWYhuoA3nNNf53tPYaOs_mdOspIj1pgti2Vb0YgNAeKERJ2KteVNfCI585gVcMczcsW7udGKRByWtG9iH8FAxEAfdc9Kve-FDf03S1qw3P_-QE1u1xfLhGSZe1c-ZAd02-e7Khm2mQcXiTKbz0ODhy-XlsKfqdvsmPhxdp5zDY7PbyqASw9FYl8wr8j8QyXpgnTPr5CTyOxq_WZ45hNndx8-N4o9F54s0D0JB5q4XNE3RxcPE6Hi_N9h8V9g9F9ZmLPmxfBJ80rF5nAtKyyGRHBedup5WJotwwmMJwhI56eyChS3jDmDEtpHpRdWb0NL854lBfgO8JLTJ4xnSwhichFfEG8bbrTHt1UPJa19qZ5hPcOPVjCLDUDOVpoYuHNeYcjBPw63gwbDTST-UBulArR1MzvXwRCIea5-E9XKnPYb67tFt6np8NCPP42FBwf6EWFLk0xMe28vMMT2LrEFNzyhnCk0MEok6R1CmiC0SaHyRwbnI4YDOW6xhgmf9PowVsKkNlSYzzh8Vv-563pMO4egt9jOdYnlQ0kov0q7esIkKyj_Xn2m0jq7ce84mchq89MLqV0usu-y-yrj0J6BWXWzkACMowwwYQNvjT3rrVZsIVSlsB-Zr0FHe_gVWrt2oI8zd11Y8JaI-mtJFYjHjBLJbkxuSIiL7XpDFP0MeHYIFLO_AvY3BcacO3Gp_C6uYqtBYBPxiqBPKPtAxBhi7giMayszHYvMevnSeh1kkm2wnoKC11fCjuL-BTkcBxDQL4Kq1lCao4LNeQ9bj-G8v0ZiQodx1epbBxTDANcbljufBgeJoOgGgBy5-UhRq9vCbvBVMb9HGyjvVH6zOm05z8ijrczSCvxTZuA5zWbKstAulaLdDFj2S2rNUcITDuiDq2Yk600HhOnCHV4iQSfDHTf99bAa0Ex-29V2HZ_iAyEJuqVi3G0FK6Q6JUSAFDbgEkUS4pWdd1rjb9n74zxTuRwSUIfTudiMhK-tgoyQLcYpMI1P_8tnpAd0zOa1RxDvxGs8hMJAIsqcQ5cDwn9cadWtS5VZHi5dycczAu8i42eHEUvpFVRObP_8KpxGqy9_fJCviX6ioB4hI82Vyai7biSbIwz7X4cGxWOH_yCpcd_806Er2FgYoKRASyLl9jiLx368Me1KPeaPghpIurz7gocUD0Zy-97Yeehz0jz9O_dM2NzL